# Licensing

This repository contains components released under separate open-source licenses:

1. **Analysis and export code** (`run.py`, `analysis/`, `tools/`): licensed under the **MIT License** (full text below).
2. **MATLAB plan-complexity extraction module** (`extraction/`): derived from the open-source Tomotherapy Complexity Metrics Extractor (**TCoMX v1.0**, Cavinato et al., *J Appl Clin Med Phys* 2023;24(1):e13781) and licensed under the **GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)**. The complete license text is provided in `extraction/LICENSE`.

